# Build context for api/Dockerfile.
#
# The context is the REPOSITORY ROOT, not ./api — the image runs
# `pip install .`, and that needs /pyproject.toml plus /engine/, neither of which
# is reachable from an ./api context. Both consumers use the same pairing:
#   deploy/docker-compose.yml   context: ..   dockerfile: api/Dockerfile
#   deploy/render.yaml          dockerContext: .   dockerfilePath: ./api/Dockerfile
#
# So this file has one job: keep the root context small and clean. Excluding
# web/ and .venv/ alone takes it from ~1 GB to a few megabytes, which on Render's
# free tier is the difference between a two-minute and a fifteen-minute build.
#
# ── WHAT MUST NOT BE EXCLUDED (the image breaks without them) ──
#   pyproject.toml   packaging metadata
#   README.md        pyproject declares `readme = "README.md"`; setuptools errors
#                    out with "readme file not found" if it is missing
#   engine/          the package being installed
#   api/             the FastAPI application
#   data/fixtures/   ENGINE_MODE=mock reads these at request time

# ─── The other half of the monorepo — the API image never imports it ───────
web/

# ─── Python virtualenv: host-specific paths and binaries, never portable ───
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/

# ─── Python build / cache artefacts ────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
sdist/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
*.egg
.eggs/
.Python

# ─── Test / lint / type caches ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.hypothesis/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
tests/

# ─── Secrets — MUST NOT reach any image layer. `docker history` reads layers ─
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
secrets/

# ─── PRIVATE RESEARCH DATA (PII) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Raw student resumes carry names, phone numbers and emails until anonymized,
# and eval/ holds signed consent forms. These must never be baked into an image
# that gets pushed to a registry. data/fixtures/, data/jds/ and
# data/resumes/anonymized/ stay in — mock mode needs them.
data/resumes/raw/
eval/

# ─── VCS, CI and deployment config: read by GitHub and Render, not by the image ─
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/
deploy/
.dockerignore

# ─── Documentation and planning ────────────────────────────────────────────
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# ─── Editors / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─── Local scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
scratch/
tmp/
*.log
